---
import EditorialLayout from "../layouts/EditorialLayout.astro";
---

<EditorialLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this site uses Google Analytics and handles information about visits."
>
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="section-label">Site information</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This site uses Google Analytics 4 to understand how people find and use its
      pages. Analytics helps me improve the site and see which career stories,
      projects, and experiments are useful to visitors.
    </p>

    <h2>Information collected</h2>
    <p>
      When you visit, Google Analytics may collect information such as pages
      viewed, interactions, approximate location derived from your network
      address, browser and device information, and identifiers stored in
      cookies. Google Analytics uses this information to distinguish visits,
      measure site activity, and prepare reports. I do not use this site to ask
      for or collect account details, payment information, or other information
      that directly identifies you.
    </p>

    <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Google processes Analytics data on my behalf under its terms and privacy
      policies. Learn more in
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's Privacy Policy</a>
      and Google's
      <a href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/7318509?hl=en">
        information about Analytics privacy disclosures
      </a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can limit cookies through your browser settings. Google also provides
      a <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">
        browser add-on to opt out of Google Analytics
      </a>. Blocking or deleting cookies may affect how Analytics measures your
      visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
    <p>
      This site is published with GitHub Pages and its domain uses Cloudflare
      DNS. These services may process technical request information, such as IP
      addresses and browser details, to deliver, secure, and operate the site.
      Their handling of information is described in the
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement">
        GitHub Privacy Statement
      </a>
      and
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this privacy notice, contact me through one of the
      profile links on the <a href="/about/">About page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</EditorialLayout>
